          "heading": "Matt Dawson urges England to embrace favourites tag against All Blacks",
          "body": "Fresh from a 78-15 win over Japan at Twickenham, Matt Dawson's BBC column argues England should lean into the role. \"I would love to see the England players absolutely bombarded with the favourites tag before their meeting with New Zealand,\" he writes, and says he genuinely believes they are favourites. Dawson also credits Wales' 35-28 win over the All Blacks in Cardiff with giving him real faith in this England side."
