        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Matthieu Jalibert recalled to France squad for Argentina Test; Hugo Avogadro named",
          "body": "Jalibert replaces Louis Le Brun in the 42-man group named for Saturday's Test, ending a spell out since a right quadriceps tear on 20 September that was set back by a relapse in mid-October. The other main options, Romain Ntamack, Thomas Ramos and Antoine Hastoy, are all injured. Anthony Jelonch, back from a concussion sustained at Pau, and Nicolas Depoortere also return, while Bordeaux Bègles winger Hugo Avogadro earns his first senior call-up. Julien Marchand is not on the list."
        },
