          "kicker": "Press reaction",
          "heading": "Foreign press says Italy dominated Argentina but wasted chances in Genoa defeat",
          "body": "Italy's 19-14 defeat to Argentina in Genoa on Saturday is being read abroad as a match the Azzurri controlled for long spells before wasting their chances. RugbyPass said Quesada's side looked transformed from the team beaten 66-7 by South Africa a week earlier, but failed to make its spell of dominance count. Planetrugby pinpointed Italy's lineout throw, which worked to international standard only rarely, as one of the main reasons they could not capitalise on pressure."
