          "kicker": "Pathway win",
          "heading": "Alfie Prygodzicz inspires Wales U19s to 34-31 comeback win over France",
          "body": "Wales U19s beat France U19s 34-31 at St Helen's on Saturday, with Cardiff back-row Alfie Prygodzicz leading the side from the front. France led 17-5 at half-time, but Wales scored 24 unanswered points after the restart, and Prygodzicz crossed twice in quick succession to put his side in command. It was Wales' first win over France at any age-grade level for six years, and the young side had watched the senior team beat the All Blacks in their hotel beforehand."
        },
