          "heading": "Max Jorgensen's late try falls short as Wallabies lose 15-12 at Murrayfield",
          "body": "The Wallabies were beaten 15-12 at Murrayfield on Sunday, their fourth straight Test defeat, despite a late rally. Harry Potter's try had levelled the scores after Matt Fagerson opened for Scotland, but Jack Dempsey's score before half-time left Australia 5-12 down at the break. Finn Russell's penalty in the 74th minute put Scotland two scores clear before Jorgensen crossed late. Defensively the Wallabies were markedly better, with Fraser McReight making 26 tackles without a miss."
